# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PETTY_CASH_API_KEY  (REQUIRED, server-side only)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The X-API-Key the app sends to the PHP backend
# (https://cultform.ecultify.com/api/petty-cash).
#
# - Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_ — this must stay on the server only.
# - The key is CASE-SENSITIVE. Paste it EXACTLY: no uppercasing, no 'O'/'0'
#   swaps, no surrounding spaces or newlines.
# - Local dev: copy this file to .env.local and fill the value there.
# - Production (Hostinger): set this in hPanel -> Node.js -> Environment
#   Variables, then RESTART the Node app. A .env.local file is NOT deployed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PETTY_CASH_API_KEY=
